  "description": "Luxury Wedding Monogram is an elegant and timeless monogram alphabet featuring romantic heart accents, delicate ribbon bows, and botanical wreath elements. This complete A–Z wedding alphabet is perfect for creating personalized wedding initials, invitations, logos, bridal decor, engagement designs, anniversary gifts, Cricut projects, vinyl decals, and luxury wedding crafts. Designed with a soft romantic and minimalist aesthetic, this monogram set adds a sophisticated and stylish touch to modern wedding creations.",
